ue); flagged unexpected or missing columns.')\nlines.append('2. **Type Checking**: Verified numeric columns (quantity, revenue) contain valid numeric values.')\nlines.append('3. **Missing Value Detection**: Identified and counted null values per column.')\nlines.append('4. **Duplicate Detection**: Identified duplicate rows.')\nlines.append('5. **Outlier Detection**: Applied IQR method (1.5x) on revenue values to detect outliers.')\nlines.append('6. **Repair**: Recoverable issues were repaired:')\nlines.append('   - Schema drift: removed unexpected columns')\nlines.append('   - Type errors: coerced to numeric')\nlines.append('   - Missing values: imputed with median (numeric) or mode (categorical)')\nlines.append('   - Duplicates: removed duplicate rows')\nlines.append('7. **Revalidation**: Repaired data was re-checked to confirm all issues were resolved.')\nlines.append('8. **Statistics**: Quarterly and annual statistics were computed.')\nlines.append('')\nlines.append('### Per-File Quality Evidence')\nlines.append('')\nfor i, q in enumerate(quarters, 1):\n    lines.append('#### Q' + str(i))\n    issues = q.get('detected_issues', {})\n    repairs = q.get('repairs_applied', [])\n    rev = q.get('revalidation', {})\n    lines.append('- Schema drift: ' + ('Yes' if issues.get('schema_drift') else 'No'))\n    lines.append('- Type errors: ' + (', '.join(issues.get('type_errors', [])) if issues.get('type_errors') else 'None'))\n    lines.append('- Missing values: ' + str(issues.get('missing_values', {})))\n    lines.append('- Duplicates found: ' + str(issues.get('duplicates', 0)))\n    lines.append('- Outliers detected: ' + str(issues.get('outlier_count', 0)))\n    lines.append('- Repairs applied: ' + ('; '.join(repairs) if repairs else 'None'))\n    lines.append('- Remaining missing after repair: ' + str(rev.get('remaining_missing', 'N/A')))\nlines.append('')\nreport = '\\n'.join(lines)\nenv['final_report'] = report",
